{"id": "Deb9j7oxWuM", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "No creature with 2 legs or 4 legs could kill him. So Maa Durga came with SIX. 🐝\n\nArunasura prayed for 40,000 years (on leaves, then water, then air, then nothing) until Brahma gave him a boon: no\nweapon, nothing with two legs, nothing with four could kill him. He threw the gods out of heaven.\n\nSo the Devi came as BHRAMARI, the goddess of black bees. Millions of six-legged bees poured from her hands and hair,\nand no boon could stop them. He feared every lion and every elephant. He never feared a bee.\n\nAt Srisailam she is worshipped as Bhramaramba, and devotees say you can still hear her bees behind the shrine.\n(Devi Bhagavata Purana, Book 10)\n\nHave you been to SRISAILAM or KATEEL? Comment your city! 👇\nSave this for Navratri, and share it with someone who loves the Devi's stories. 🙏\n\nMore stories of the Devi and the gods: follow @therishikatha · rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n#bhramari #maadurga #durgamaa #navadurga #srisailam #bhramaramba #kateel #devibhagavatam #hindumythology #sanatandharma #jaimatadi #mythologystories #indianmythology #reelsindia #rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1791899740, "like_count": 18815, "comment_count": 88, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1080718724583694a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.131, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO1SGxHZXBdaoAKqUYrDnVXrSpLJIapQCKtBEPKri0SuO-TToSW3dfcy9ypg75l0q5EHKxjtrjIRcgVurz20RfMrznG4eZ91atxrgE.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Adr1R5c9utY4b0X1tijEUWtLnnVFer-qXr1kA6swX2L6Ug_wSaHLrD24JeYbQ4Ns_tyoz2eatPTE1vXbqz5EsjWl&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=sv85nL8xr3MQ7kNvwEZvydc&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ParoIfYhM5g5_OBCJN9GUQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_m